Add HoldMem four-cell reference implementation, baselines and smoke driver

HoldMem: shared writer outputs, D=1 checker with programmatic fallback,
B=1 keys at source-epoch or object-cluster granularity, append-only B=0,
consent filter, JSON arm rendering and five-part cost counters. Zero system,
oracle and plain RAG share the reader template and 4k budget. LLM client
caches responses by request hash. Run manifests record commit, worlds,
models, images and SHA256 of every output. Stage 0.4 smoke driver.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
